en_US:
Hi, Trainer! Do you know a Pokémon
called Audino?{VAR BE01}
It's a Pokémon that I sometimes find
when I'm walking.{VAR BE01}
It jumps out of rustling grass.
I can get a lot of Exp. Points.{VAR BE01}
It's kind of a friendly Pokémon, isn't it?

When you choose “HELP"
at the PC at a Pokémon Center,{VAR BE00}
you can learn many things. It's so cool!
